IEEE Registration Authority data
--------------------------------

The bundled MAC address vendor database is derived from the public IEEE
Registration Authority listings MA-L, MA-M and MA-S
(https://standards-oui.ieee.org/), maintained by the Institute of Electrical
and Electronics Engineers, Inc. (IEEE). The listings are provided as is,
without any warranty of accuracy or completeness. Updated listings can be
imported in the program via "Settings > MAC database".

